Linguists break through; the only option opens the channel and ends first contact.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n无分叉。/ No branches.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n正文分排外/灭绝倾向两种；图片随军国/排外/机械变化。/ Two text variants (xenophobe/homicidal or not); picture varies with ethics.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对 Checked：脚本与两个通用收尾阶段（含 103/104 的并列权重）。/ Script and both generic end stages including the weight-50 siblings 103/104.\n- 审阅改动 Changes：无结构改动（共享收尾页，作为独立篇保留）。/ No structural change; kept as a shared closing page.\n","path":"summaries/event-first-contact-100.md"}}